🧠 Introduction

In this project, you will build a **console-based Tic-Tac-Toe game** using Java.

👉 This helps you practice:

✔ Loops
✔ Conditionals
✔ Arrays
✔ User Input

---

🎯 Objective

Create a **2-player game** where:

* Player 1 → X
* Player 2 → O
* Players take turns
* Game detects a winner or a draw

